# Secrets.
#
# .secrets/test.env holds a live API key. It must never be committed, and it is
# listed first so it is the first thing anyone reads here. If a key is ever
# staged by accident, rotate it: rewriting history does not un-leak a value.
#
# The CLI keeps its own credentials outside the repository, in ~/.Sael, so a
# working copy never holds one at all.
.secrets/
.env

# The Go toolchain, installed inside the repository on the machine this was
# built on. It is ~270 MB of binary that no clone wants; install Go normally
# instead.
.tools/

# Build and test output.
/bin/
/dist/
coverage.out
coverage.html
*.out
*.test
*.prof

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
